===Noun===
{{be-noun|мозг<c>}}

# [[brain]]

====Usage Notes====
Together with {{m|be|лязг}}, this is a rather unique phonetically awkward word <ref>'''2017'''. [[w:Naša Niva|Naša Niva]]. [https://nashaniva.com/?c=ar&i=194539 Што адбываецца з беларускай мовай — папулярна расказваем пра першы арфаэпічны слоўнік].</ref>. There's even an opinion that historically only its plural form was actually correct in the Belarusian language. And yet modern dictionaries got its singular form too.

